<title>USA: WHX Corp names John Scheessele president.</title>
<headline>WHX Corp names John Scheessele president.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>WHX Corp said on Tuesday that John Scheessele will replace James Wareham as president of WHX and chief executive of its subsidiary, Wheeling-Pittsburgh Steel Corp.</p>
<p>Wareham is leaving to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>Scheessele is a former president of WCI Steel.</p>
</text>
